      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Review and improve this health article before publication.\n\nCheck all medical and factual claims for accuracy and safety.\nCorrect, remove, or rewrite claims that are unsupported, exaggerated,\nmisleading, or medically unsafe.\n\nKeep the article useful, natural, engaging, and SEO-friendly.\nDo not invent facts, statistics, studies, or medical claims.\nDo not diagnose readers.\nAdd appropriate advice to consult a healthcare professional when\nthe topic or symptoms warrant it.\n\nPreserve the article's headings and useful information.\n\nReturn ONLY the final polished article with its SEO information.\nDo not explain your edits.\n\nARTICLE:\n\n{{ $json.output }}",
